WEBVTT

00:04.421 --> 00:05.255
Eren.

00:05.588 --> 00:06.965
You're a man!

00:07.882 --> 00:09.092
Show some self-discipline!

00:09.509 --> 00:11.177
You need to be there for Mikasa, too!

00:12.262 --> 00:15.640
Stop!

02:15.593 --> 02:16.761
Damn that Reiner!

02:17.011 --> 02:19.055
He's tossing the Titans like a madman!

02:35.071 --> 02:36.656
This is all your fault!

02:36.865 --> 02:39.159
You screwed up my entire plan,

02:39.284 --> 02:41.411
you damn commander!

02:49.210 --> 02:50.128
Ymir!

02:50.461 --> 02:52.755
-Conny, that way!
-I know!

02:55.967 --> 02:57.010
Commander!

02:58.553 --> 03:00.388
I can always be replaced.

03:01.306 --> 03:03.683
More importantly, find Eren and retreat!

03:04.767 --> 03:06.311
Time is of the essence!

03:19.282 --> 03:20.116
Eren!

03:25.622 --> 03:26.706
Hannes!

03:33.504 --> 03:35.173
What are the odds of this?

03:35.340 --> 03:37.050
Check it out, you two!

03:37.634 --> 03:38.801
You just watch it.

03:39.177 --> 03:41.179
I'm about to avenge your mother

03:41.346 --> 03:43.598
and butcher the hell out of it!

03:47.936 --> 03:48.937
Hannes!

03:50.063 --> 03:51.648
Back up the old man!

03:52.440 --> 03:53.274
What?

04:00.323 --> 04:02.158
What's Reiner doing?

04:03.284 --> 04:05.578
Does he not care if Eren is eaten?

04:05.912 --> 04:09.499
Don't get in our way,
you big sack of shit!

04:17.757 --> 04:18.841
Ymir!

04:20.551 --> 04:23.012
Damn it! What am I supposed to do?

04:23.888 --> 04:25.098
If I can't count on Reiner,

04:25.306 --> 04:28.142
should I team up with the Scouts
and try to survive?

04:31.396 --> 04:33.773
But what happens after that?

04:34.857 --> 04:37.652
Even if I can somehow
live through all this,

04:38.152 --> 04:41.906
there's no avoiding the hell
that's being trapped inside the walls.

04:43.199 --> 04:46.536
Now's my only chance
to hand Historia over to their side!

04:47.328 --> 04:50.873
I won't be able to protect her by myself,
no matter how hard I try.

04:56.045 --> 04:57.005
Christa!

04:57.630 --> 04:59.132
No, Conny.

04:59.924 --> 05:02.010
My name is Historia.

05:03.261 --> 05:05.138
Hey, Ymir...

05:06.222 --> 05:09.142
Why were you trying to take me away?

05:10.143 --> 05:12.729
You said it was about saving yourself,
but was it a lie?

05:15.023 --> 05:17.233
No. It has to be.

05:19.027 --> 05:21.988
Why? Why did you do it?

05:26.451 --> 05:27.410
For me?

05:29.287 --> 05:31.039
To protect me again?

05:32.373 --> 05:33.458
It's a Titan!

05:36.753 --> 05:37.628
Ymir...

05:38.171 --> 05:41.424
You're the one who said it,
so listen to yourself!

05:43.301 --> 05:45.303
Stop living for other people!

05:45.887 --> 05:47.221
From now on,

05:47.513 --> 05:49.432
let's live for nobody but ourselves!

05:50.892 --> 05:52.602
It's strange, really...

05:53.102 --> 05:55.772
When I'm with you,
no matter how screwed up it gets...

05:56.939 --> 05:58.357
I'm not afraid!

06:06.365 --> 06:07.200
Shit!

06:18.878 --> 06:21.214
Mikasa, don't do it! You're injured!

06:23.508 --> 06:25.718
-Untie my hands!
-Hands?

06:26.886 --> 06:27.804
Hurry up!

06:28.179 --> 06:30.431
I've got to be the one to do it!

06:32.433 --> 06:34.644
Who said I was done with you?

06:36.938 --> 06:39.649
-That one is mine!
-Eren!

06:40.566 --> 06:43.027
Wait! We're trying to get you out of here!

06:43.945 --> 06:46.989
It's time to settle the score! Just watch!

06:56.332 --> 06:57.375
What?

07:03.756 --> 07:04.590
Commander!

07:05.258 --> 07:06.134
The Armored one is...

07:07.760 --> 07:08.928
It's coming!

07:13.307 --> 07:14.183
Jean!

07:19.355 --> 07:20.273
Jean!

07:21.941 --> 07:22.984
Are you okay?

07:23.818 --> 07:25.319
Hold it together!

07:31.033 --> 07:32.034
Damn it!

07:32.869 --> 07:33.828
Damn it!

07:35.788 --> 07:36.831
What's wrong?

07:40.960 --> 07:41.794
Eren!

08:02.356 --> 08:03.608
Commander!

08:24.086 --> 08:25.087
Right now...

08:25.671 --> 08:27.298
I must become a Titan...

08:30.551 --> 08:32.178
or it's all for nothing!

09:15.263 --> 09:16.097
Eren...

09:17.473 --> 09:18.516
Nothing has changed!

09:19.267 --> 09:21.936
You haven't changed one bit, damn it!

09:23.187 --> 09:25.856
You're still as useless as ever!

09:28.067 --> 09:29.610
Nothing has changed!

09:40.788 --> 09:41.914
Mom...

09:42.790 --> 09:44.625
I can't...

09:46.043 --> 09:49.672
I still can't do anything at all...

09:50.673 --> 09:51.507
Eren...

09:59.181 --> 10:00.683
That's not true.

10:20.870 --> 10:21.704
Eren...

10:23.372 --> 10:24.290
Listen...

10:26.250 --> 10:27.710
I need to tell you something.

10:33.007 --> 10:35.926
You've always been by my side...

10:36.969 --> 10:37.845
Thank you.

10:42.516 --> 10:46.187
You showed me how to live with purpose...

10:48.272 --> 10:49.190
Thank you.

10:55.196 --> 10:56.072
And you...

10:59.950 --> 11:01.661
You wrapped this scarf around me.

11:02.411 --> 11:03.245
Thank you.

11:26.560 --> 11:27.645
I'll wrap that around you...

11:28.896 --> 11:30.481
as many times as you want.

11:33.234 --> 11:34.777
Now and forever.

11:35.486 --> 11:36.987
As much as you want!

12:39.425 --> 12:41.552
Why are they...

12:42.636 --> 12:43.804
They're eating it?

12:50.102 --> 12:52.313
I don't know what's going on,
but now's our chance!

12:52.605 --> 12:54.482
-Let's hurry and run!
-Right!

12:55.274 --> 12:56.734
So that's how it is...

12:57.234 --> 12:59.904
That's why Reiner was so desperate
for Eren.

13:00.946 --> 13:03.157
Which means, even inside the walls...

13:04.366 --> 13:05.576
there's a future.

13:10.039 --> 13:11.290
This is the worst...

13:12.333 --> 13:14.126
Why did the Coordinate have to fall 

13:14.835 --> 13:17.046
into the hands
of the worst person imaginable?

13:17.588 --> 13:19.215
We've got to get it back...

13:20.007 --> 13:22.968
I can say, without a doubt...

13:23.594 --> 13:26.347
the one person in the world
I wouldn't want to have it...

13:26.931 --> 13:29.350
is you, Eren!

13:30.518 --> 13:31.852
Get away from me!

13:33.103 --> 13:36.023
You bastards! I'll kill you all!

13:45.115 --> 13:47.326
Not good! Bertholdt!

13:48.702 --> 13:50.496
I can't protect Bertholdt like this!

13:50.788 --> 13:52.289
What? The Titans?

13:52.706 --> 13:53.541
Eren!

13:55.125 --> 13:56.752
-Get on!
-Armin!

13:58.045 --> 13:58.879
Hurry!

13:59.797 --> 14:01.298
Don't let this chance slip!

14:02.007 --> 14:03.467
Full retreat!

14:12.601 --> 14:13.435
Ymir!

14:14.186 --> 14:17.314
Hey, ugly! What are you doing?
We're heading back!

14:28.325 --> 14:29.994
Sorry...

14:31.787 --> 14:32.788
What?

14:38.168 --> 14:39.962
Where are you going, Ymir?

14:40.337 --> 14:42.339
-Leave her!
-But she's...

15:04.028 --> 15:05.070
In that moment,

15:05.863 --> 15:09.033
I couldn't understand the motivation
behind Ymir's actions...

15:10.326 --> 15:13.746
but the Armored Titan
didn't pursue us any further.

15:49.823 --> 15:50.658
Ymir...

15:51.450 --> 15:53.202
Why did you come to us?

15:54.244 --> 15:56.121
Oh, well...

15:57.081 --> 15:58.791
It's because I'm an idiot.

15:59.708 --> 16:02.378
I'll be your souvenir to take back home.

16:04.171 --> 16:06.507
You can't just go back empty-handed.

16:07.758 --> 16:08.634
Ymir...

16:09.885 --> 16:12.346
If you hadn't come to break this wall...

16:13.430 --> 16:16.141
I would've never woken up
from that nightmare.

16:17.643 --> 16:18.936
All I'm doing...

16:20.187 --> 16:22.856
is returning what I borrowed back then.

16:25.025 --> 16:27.361
Because I'm probably the only one...

16:28.070 --> 16:29.530
that understands the situation you're in.

16:31.907 --> 16:34.076
Thank you, Ymir.

16:35.244 --> 16:36.286
I'm sorry...

16:37.788 --> 16:38.706
No...

16:42.668 --> 16:44.336
It wasn't so bad, you know,

16:44.628 --> 16:46.213
being a goddess for a while.

16:51.510 --> 16:55.139
With reports declaring the possibility
that Wall Rose had been breached,

16:55.764 --> 16:57.307
the citizens of Wall Rose
had to take refuge

16:57.641 --> 17:01.478
in an underground city within Wall Sina.

17:03.230 --> 17:05.733
However,
with more than half the population

17:05.899 --> 17:09.445
surviving off food stockpiled
for an emergency,

17:10.070 --> 17:12.114
rations would last at most for a week.

17:13.574 --> 17:14.867
Any longer than that,

17:15.451 --> 17:17.244
people would turn on each other, 

17:17.619 --> 17:19.997
and steal and kill to survive.

17:21.623 --> 17:23.125
To stop this from happening,

17:23.542 --> 17:25.711
within a week from the initial outset,

17:26.378 --> 17:29.798
authorities declared
that Wall Rose was secure.

17:31.675 --> 17:35.554
TROST DISTRICT

17:42.227 --> 17:44.229
It's Hanji. Come in.

17:44.980 --> 17:46.857
Pardon the interruption, Erwin.

17:49.443 --> 17:51.987
I'm glad we came while you're here,
Commander Pyxis.

17:53.614 --> 17:55.908
Good timing. This is...

17:56.200 --> 17:59.411
A Scout from the 104th. Conny Springer.

17:59.995 --> 18:02.456
Conny comes from Ragako Village.

18:03.707 --> 18:06.752
The village the recent Titan invasion
originated from?

18:07.086 --> 18:07.920
Yes.

18:08.629 --> 18:09.630
Actually,

18:09.713 --> 18:12.841
I confirmed with him the findings
of our investigation of the village.

18:13.467 --> 18:16.178
This only brings further credibility
to that hypothesis.

18:16.887 --> 18:18.597
He's come to report.

18:23.602 --> 18:25.270
I was taken away...

18:26.230 --> 18:27.439
And because of that,

18:27.648 --> 18:31.527
the Scouts lost more than half
of their veteran soldiers.

18:33.112 --> 18:34.947
Just to rescue me...

18:37.491 --> 18:40.285
Still, there were no casualties
on our way back.

18:41.620 --> 18:43.539
The Titans completely ignored us

18:43.789 --> 18:46.208
and ran off to chase Reiner and others.

18:47.334 --> 18:50.712
As for that, Jean and I sat down
to try and figure it out.

18:53.340 --> 18:56.093
We might know
what made the Titans act that way.

18:57.719 --> 18:58.720
It was you.

19:01.014 --> 19:02.724
Of course, that's just our theory.

19:04.309 --> 19:06.186
But without assuming that,

19:06.854 --> 19:08.605
there's just no explaining what happened.

19:10.566 --> 19:12.693
It's a tough spot to be in, Eren.

19:13.402 --> 19:15.737
Whether or not
all those people died for nothing...

19:16.905 --> 19:18.657
it all depends on you.

19:20.033 --> 19:23.453
If you're worth the price they paid,
you better show it.

19:25.664 --> 19:27.291
We don't have time to waste.

19:33.088 --> 19:35.716
Yes, you're absolutely right.

19:37.801 --> 19:39.219
I've got to do this.

19:39.553 --> 19:41.346
I'll control the Titans.

19:41.930 --> 19:43.515
I'll plug up Wall Maria.

19:44.141 --> 19:46.935
I'll capture Reiner and make him pay.

19:48.228 --> 19:49.646
That's what I've got to do

19:50.147 --> 19:51.815
to make up for all those lives lost.

19:55.152 --> 19:56.069
Say again?

19:57.863 --> 20:00.115
The Titans are responsible
for this incident

20:00.574 --> 20:02.367
were the citizens of Ragako?

20:04.786 --> 20:07.664
In other words,
the true identity of the Titans...

20:08.790 --> 20:10.250
is human?

20:13.921 --> 20:16.298
We don't have proof yet.

20:17.466 --> 20:19.676
So you're telling me...

20:20.636 --> 20:23.472
I've spent all this time and energy

20:24.932 --> 20:27.267
running around killing people?

20:28.227 --> 20:29.102
Is that right?

20:31.188 --> 20:33.148
I said we don't have proof yet.

20:44.785 --> 20:45.619
Erwin.

20:49.081 --> 20:51.416
What the hell...

20:52.501 --> 20:53.835
are you smiling about?

20:58.632 --> 20:59.883
It's nothing.

21:02.970 --> 21:04.096
We've...

21:04.972 --> 21:08.767
taken one more step towards the truth.

21:10.936 --> 21:12.521
Just one step?

21:13.397 --> 21:16.400
We'll run out of people
before we learn the truth.

21:17.025 --> 21:18.402
It's not worth the cost.

21:19.778 --> 21:21.738
But it is a step towards the truth.

21:23.156 --> 21:25.742
One day, we'll break it down.

21:27.160 --> 21:28.870
This wall hiding the truth...

21:30.914 --> 21:31.957
will fall.

22:01.695 --> 22:02.821
Not yet.
